{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1602.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"774a7781f2f85bcfebc5e7159a9546346f467143ce6c66a4dc94aae7b3c40618","ja":"だ、大丈夫、瑞希ちゃん！？　ケガはしてない？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1602.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"d70d6b196314ca0f10aebb07586ab638ce9b1a1b41e287e89e82e2a72d4b7529","ja":"はい、大丈夫です。\nですが、中身がすべて飛び出てしまいました。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1602.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"8eea37d41c63902f8f298e9da99c48c05a14426e71c3320705b928f1bcd92fc7","ja":"ケガがなくてよかった。それに、壊れそうなものは\n入ってなかったみたいだよ。一緒に片付けよう。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1602.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"e24a4c2e79eda7bbd0b8937a2ea047f7093d2dd6bf43db0a5eacdf498d4bb53f","ja":"ですが、萩原さんの手も止まってしまいます。\nせっかく勝つチャンスなのに……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1602.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"49c418b17737796f6438fa684ecd5ea78247f82bcfd46a3992a72390768fe8fa","ja":"いいよ。だって私たち、\n競争相手だけど、敵じゃないんだから。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1602.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"3d1a2c4ae023a21247052d01acd6f132a333142fd807a9e3ae8861a6a91329d9","ja":"ひとりじゃ大変だなって時は、\n協力し合ってもいいと思うんだけど……どうかな？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1602.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"70152d57890514b1b76db929b92cb28716b3984d193fa543f70dcca546be2cf4","ja":"……そうですね。\nでは、片付けのお手伝い、お願いします。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1602.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"7ab5fab0cbb36d272ab2079d6995adb40e0686ac7481ba3dfcf93f0103b26327","ja":"ふぅ……やっと終わったぁ。\n思ったより早く終わってよかったね！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1602.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"e4e219ade33e7a978d4ab8bad4e0cb9cabebb5bacd6dad43af3a327b61b85c3c","ja":"はい。萩原さんのおかげです。\nこの後、どこかへ遊びにいきませんか？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1602.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"bee390e9935ceea7e5d648072e66293bf5784fab4c47de363e7f57bd6b7206d0","ja":"それなら私、おすすめのお茶屋さんがあって……\nあ、でも最近すっごくいい和カフェも見つけて……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1602.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"232d61c433a20c1ce0eb4f1308fd83cc6250810d80ef0a5f38ecc60331f00325","ja":"どうしよう？　お店は反対方向だから、両方行くのは\n難しいし……でも、どっちも素敵で……！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1602.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"77856a963926094e425f8235c53692547f4599a0713cc34d276d72ff10fd04ae","ja":"では、まずはそのふたつのお店のことを\n詳しく聞かせてください。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1602.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"4f13dd832a3fa715366e402a29b554d68134746406d235aca1325288468de074","ja":"そして、どちらに行くか一緒に考えましょう。\n……協力し合い、です。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1602.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"0a27e12504e472bafe22adc1c1166a99c42d8e2316d709090571a3f674e6c751","ja":"あ……ふふ、そうだね♪　ありがとう、瑞希ちゃん。\nええとね、まずはお茶屋さんなんだけど……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
